</li></ul><p><span>Printable handout containing facts about Vote by Mail for the November 3, 2026 election. The handout contains information about recent federal lawsuits, USPS ballot mail handling and deadlines for the upcoming&nbsp;election.</span></p><h2 id="section-1">Reporting</h2><ul><li dir="ltr"><a href="/info/november-3-2026-election-results-multnomah-county" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="3412a25e-5c2f-4f17-9a24-e9df65e99252" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="November 3, 2026 Election Results - Multnomah County"><strong>Election Results</strong></a> - Results available beginning at 8:00 p.m., November 3, 2026&nbsp;<ul><li dir="ltr"><a href="/info/election-results-schedule-nov-2026-general-election" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="c22d90ad-6ca1-42b5-af36-f0f24de4973c" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Election Results Schedule - Nov. 2026 General Election">Election Results Reporting Schedule</a></li></ul></li></ul><h3>Daily Ballot Returns</h3><ul><li><a href="https://multco.us/info/voter-turnout-november-2026-election" data-entity-type="external">Voter Turnout</a> - Daily ballot returns &amp; percentages</li><li>Visualization Dashboard - Daily ballot returns and turnout including returns by&nbsp;precinct, district, and&nbsp;source<ul><li><a href="https://public.tableau.com/app/profile/multco.ballot.returns/viz/Multco_Elections_Dashboard_Nov2026/OFFICIALDashboard"><span>Multco_Elections_Dashboard_Nov2026</span></a></li></ul></li></ul><h2 id="section-2"><span>Voter Guides and Election Information</span></h2><h3>Voters' Pamphlet&nbsp;</h3><ul><li><div class="h-100 mb-3">
  
      
