<p>Important dates for candidates:</p><ul><li dir="ltr"><span>Aug. 18, 2026 - Filing deadline for&nbsp;</span><strong>elected incumbent</strong><span> candidates</span></li><li dir="ltr"><span>Aug. 25, 2026 - Filing deadline for&nbsp;</span><strong>non-incumbent (new)</strong><span> and&nbsp;</span><strong>appointed incumbent</strong><span> candidates</span></li><li dir="ltr"><span>Aug. 25, 2026 - County Voters' pamphlet deadline for candidates</span></li><li dir="ltr">Oct, 27, 2026 - Certified write-in filing deadline (for County positions)</li></ul><hr><h2 id="section-4">Other Information</h2><h3><span>Ranked Choice Voting (RCV)</span></h3><p><span>Multnomah County voters will use RCV to elect:</span></p><ul><li dir="ltr"><span>County Chair&nbsp;</span></li><li dir="ltr"><span>Commissioner, District 2</span></li><li dir="ltr"><span>City of Portland voters will use RCV to elect:&nbsp;</span><ul><li dir="ltr"><span>City Auditor&nbsp;</span></li><li dir="ltr"><span>City Councilors, Districts 3 and 4</span></li></ul></li><li dir="ltr"><a href="https://multco.us/info/ranked-choice-voting-rcv"><span>Learn about Ranked Choice Voting</span></a></li></ul><h4>Important Dates for Voters</h4><ul><li><span lang="EN" dir="ltr">Sep. 18, 2026 - Military/overseas ballots mailed</span></li><li><span lang="EN" dir="ltr">Sep. 21, 2026 - Absentee ballots available</span></li><li><span lang="EN" dir="ltr">Oct. 5, 2026 - Out of state ballots mailed</span></li><li><span lang="EN" dir="ltr">Oct. 8, 2026 - Gresham </span><a href="/info/voting-center-express-gresham" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="80f9b8d4-8425-45e7-839a-8ab96b6c6376" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Voting Center Express in Gresham"><span lang="EN" dir="ltr">Voting Center Express</span></a><span lang="EN" dir="ltr"> opens</span></li><li><span lang="EN" dir="ltr"><strong>Oct. 13, 2026 - Voter registration deadline</strong></span></li><li><span lang="EN" dir="ltr">Oct. 14, 2026 - Ballots mailed to voters</span></li><li><span lang="EN" dir="ltr"><strong>Nov. 3, 2026 - Election Day</strong></span></li><li><span lang="EN" dir="ltr">Nov. 30, 2026 - Final Election Results Certified</span></li></ul></div>
      
          </div>
  
      
  
</article>

